#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:5
msgid "Select all Parts"
msgstr "选择全部部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows selecting all `parts`_ from the `workspace`_, all "
"`parts`_ from the opened `element`_, at the same time."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许同时选择 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中的所有 `部件 <parts_>`_ 以及已打开 `元件 "
"<element_>`_ 中的所有 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:10
msgid ""
"All `parts`_ can be selected from `menu bar`_, `workspace`_ or using the "
"corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_、`工作区 <workspace_>`_ 或使用相应的快捷键选择所有 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:14
msgid "Select all parts from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏选择全部部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:16
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Select all** menu item to select all `parts`_ from the "
"opened `element`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 全选** 菜单项，选择已打开 `元件 <element_>`_ 中的所有 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:24
msgid "Select all parts from workspace"
msgstr "从工作区选择全部部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:26
msgid ""
"As many other CAD tools, QElectroTech allows selecting all `parts`_ from the"
" `workspace`_ using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"与许多其他 CAD 工具一样，QElectroTech 允许使用鼠标选择 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中的所有 `部件 <parts_>`_"
" 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:28
msgid ""
"Left click on the initial point from the rectangular area to be selected and"
" displace the mouse without releasing the button."
msgstr "在要选择的矩形区域的起点点击左键，然后按住左键拖动鼠标。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:33
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor selecting on workspace"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器在工作区中选择"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:36
msgid "Select all objects using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键选择所有对象"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:38
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:40
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + a`` to select all `parts`_ from the opened `element`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + a`` 选择已打开 `元件 <element_>`_ 中的所有 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_all.rst:44
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
